<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.Line.AspNetCore</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.Line.AspNetCore</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.Line.AspNetCore</RootNamespace>

    <Title>Ozakboy.Line.AspNetCore — LINE Login 認證處理器與 Webhook 端點整合</Title>
    <Description>把 Ozakboy.Line 接上 ASP.NET Core:AddLineLogin() 註冊一個建立在官方 OAuthHandler 之上的 LINE Login 認證方案,自動處理 PKCE、nonce、bot_prompt 加好友引導、個人檔案與好友狀態宣告,以及 id_token 的本地驗證;MapLineWebhook() 掛上一個會先驗簽再解析的 webhook 端點,單一事件的例外不會擋住同一批的其他事件,並可開啟關鍵字自動回覆。反向代理後面請設 PublicOrigin,讓 redirect_uri 以明確的對外網址組出來而不是從請求推導。除 Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 自研套件外,零第三方相依。Wires Ozakboy.Line into ASP.NET Core: AddLineLogin() registers a LINE Login authentication scheme built on the first-party OAuthHandler, handling PKCE, nonce, the bot_prompt add-friend flow, profile and friendship claims, and local id_token validation; MapLineWebhook() maps a webhook endpoint that verifies the signature before parsing, where one event's exception never blocks the rest of the batch and keyword auto reply can run ahead of the handler. Behind a reverse proxy, PublicOrigin builds redirect_uri from a stated public address rather than deriving it from the request. No third-party dependency in the graph.</Description>
    <PackageTags>ozakboy;line;line-login;aspnetcore;authentication;oauth2;oidc;pkce;middleware;webhook;endpoint-routing;claims;auto-reply;reverse-proxy;taiwan;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.2.0: version bump alongside the core package, which gained TemplateMessage, ImagemapMessage, the sender override, video trackingId and the group, room, follower, loading animation, mark-as-read, validation, narrowcast, audience and insight endpoints. Webhook events now expose VideoPlayComplete.TrackingId, so a handler mapped with MapLineWebhook() can close the loop on a video sent with a tracking id. No change to the authentication scheme, the webhook endpoint's status codes or the claim types. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    共用框架參照:認證處理器、端點路由與 HttpRequest 都來自 ASP.NET Core 共用框架,
    不需要(也不該)逐一參照 Microsoft.AspNetCore.* 套件。
    A framework reference: the authentication handler, endpoint routing, and HttpRequest all come from the
    ASP.NET Core shared framework, so individual Microsoft.AspNetCore.* package references are neither needed
    nor appropriate.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <FrameworkReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.App" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- 打包時 ProjectReference 會自動轉成同版號的 PackageReference。 -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Ozakboy.Line\Ozakboy.Line.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
